Finally, our distribution process needs to incorporate the use of the new logistics software, ShipSmart, to streamline our shipping operations. After discussions with our IT department, I believe we can initiate training on March 25, 2023. David, please ensure the warehouse team is prepared for this transition.

Let’s touch base later this week to discuss these points further.

